      "turns": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "okay don't judge me but i think i'm gonna text jordan. i know i know. but i miss them so much right now"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Oh, I'm not judging you at all. I get it. That pull is so strong sometimes. What's making you miss them especially right now?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "help me write it. something that doesn't sound desperate. you're good with words, make it good"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Okay, let me think. Maybe something like... \"Hey, saw something that reminded me of you today, hope you're doing good.\" That's pretty low pressure. Or if you want to be a little more direct, maybe \"I've been thinking about you lately and just wanted to say hi.\" What do you think? Does either of those feel right?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "it's almost 1am and the apartment is so quiet and i just want ONE person to want to talk to me you know"
        },
